constraints_boundaries.text:
They are public - anything in a NEXTPUBLIC var ships to the browser. Never
  prefix a secret. (Marking it --sensitive does not make a NEXTPUBLIC var
  private; the prefix wins.)

constraints_boundaries.evidence:
- They are **public** - anything in a `NEXT_PUBLIC_` var ships to the browser. Never
  prefix a secret. (Marking it `--sensitive` does not make a `NEXT_PUBLIC_` var
  private; the prefix wins.)
